{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dms5XpXv5n1793092406.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國地震局公布上周四西藏巴青縣的7級地震，最高烈度達9度，造成長約25公里的地表破裂帶。</p><p></p><p>這次地震震央巴青縣瑪如鄉，以及青海雜多縣查旦鄉等地，約有450平方公里的區域，在分成12度的地震烈度中達到9度，即代表地震震度，令大多數房屋被破壞，少數倒塌、鐵軌彎曲等。</p><p></p><p>地震局在瑪如鄉約20公里處發現長約25米的地表破裂帶，最深約3.5米，寬約8至30米，南北兩側延伸到雪山上。今次地震已造成16人死亡、76人受傷。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:01:45.411671+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:27.946522+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:26.788759+00:00","content_hash":"f739fb20f7bb11abb953c2b6022d27ff499c90ab0fdf1a31ab822ec731af02b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}